                    <span class="sql-task-focus">ERD</span>
                </div>
                <p>Identify the junction table and explain why it represents a many-to-many relationship.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.2.4</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">Composite key</span>
                </div>
                <p>State the composite primary key in <code>MEMBERSHIP</code> and explain why both columns are needed together.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.2.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">One-to-one</span>
                </div>
                <p>Explain why <code>LOGIN_ACCOUNT</code> to <code>STUDENT</code> is one-to-one in this dataset.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.2.3</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">Data types</span>
                </div>
                <p>Explain why <code>YearGroup</code> is stored as an integer, while <code>Username</code> and <code>MeetingRoom</code> are text fields. Give one possible problem caused by choosing the wrong type.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
