                </div>
                <p>List every club that meets on <code>Thursday</code>.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">DISTINCT</span>
                </div>
                <p>Return each unique role used in the <code>MEMBERSHIP</code> table, sorted alphabetically.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">LIKE</span>
                </div>
                <p>Find clubs where the meeting room contains the word <code>Lab</code>.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">WHERE</span>
                </div>
                <p>Show the first names, last names, and year groups of both students whose surname is <code>Khan</code>.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </section>

